The cliché-detection patterns in rules/llm-cliches.json and
rules/wikipedia-ai.json, together with their test cases, are derived from
llm-cliche-highlighter.html in that project. A pinned copy of the original file
is kept at vendor/llm-cliche-highlighter.html, and tools/build-rules.mjs
regenerates the rule sets from it.

The wikipedia-ai rule set is adapted there from Wikipedia's "Signs of AI
writing" (https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Signs_of_AI_writing),
available under CC BY-SA 4.0.
